{"id":5600,"date":"2025-09-03T09:42:40","date_gmt":"2025-09-03T02:42:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5600"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:26:29","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:26:29","slug":"tiktok-business-center","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/tiktok-business-center\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 g\u00ec? C\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"QnIMdXzVLoggngxQH9wlFDragxe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O1p6df2ydor8zKxO01wlZTvSgaf\">Khi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n, vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n, \u0111\u1ed9i nh\u00f3m v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch s\u1ebd tr\u1edf n\u00ean ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. TikTok Business Center ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n. Vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng cho s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i trong c\u00e1c g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p b\u1edfi <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PvBidRZelo7KSbxFZ6NlkxUkgLc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WViHdFep4oyJr1xczB2loOvigRb\">TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ejv7dk1nVo499qx3vFwlHfQlgNe\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5601\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5601\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5601\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi.png\" alt=\"TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 g\u00ec\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/TikTok-Business-Center-la-gi-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5601\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 g\u00ec<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-SnvZdjZoeoB6ucxJdhZl4UIVgNb\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c3f58a6d-040b-460f-ac4e-d8dc2276f94f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSaSwbpJFYobninxEDlklGpIpgTe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;SaSwbpJFYobninxEDlklGpIpgTe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:100102,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nu4Jd3czwoPgNwxQdRLlnJi3g4f\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pik4dnI8OoeYIbxden5lU3Uhg1d\">TikTok Business Center (BC) l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd trung t\u00e2m, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 agency s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u1ecdi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng marketing v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd tr\u00ean TikTok. Hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, n\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc n\u01a1i l\u01b0u tr\u1eef d\u1eef li\u1ec7u k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1, n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, chia s\u1ebb v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh nh\u01b0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, trang TikTok, v\u00e0 pixel theo d\u00f5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ta1rdeQjKonlh3xOSUbltA9Ygle\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-E3fJd9yFjoM8x6xZqcOlb6ukgsb\">Ai n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA6YdehzLoNslrxC8CJlRhWvgxh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MGGIdujQtoOVlbxIIeQlBhUagsc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e0f01bbc-636b-41bc-826c-1e7f192b5e35&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDhb2bDRcDoMFYUxaNFZlhM9Ngzh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Dhb2bDRcDoMFYUxaNFZlhM9Ngzh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:416741,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5602\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5602\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5602\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center.png\" alt=\"Ai n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Ai-nen-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5602\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ai n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UMlYdQqZuoeiBrxVb8klLxUmgue\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TZB5dIhnuo5Jn0xvnpclTJguglb\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng d\u00e0nh cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ea7n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u1edf quy m\u00f4 l\u1edbn. B\u1ea1n n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 marketing c\u00f9ng tham gia v\u00e0o c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o. C\u00e1c Agency qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ea7n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng kh\u00e1c nhau c\u0169ng l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqwldGqfvop2AGxh2yOl4R2Zgfg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GldDdO1nPoHGRYxIJWvlmxB2gTe\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S50NdbwbGoHEAJxq5iglcj6Xg0b\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Fa8udB4BColsMDxGsd5lolSogeg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e3ddfca1-3001-4b08-99f6-03bc4a363ede&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJRKRbgQIcoH498xjgCsl4qmmgkd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JRKRbgQIcoH498xjgCsl4qmmgkd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:356905,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5603\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5603\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5603\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center.png\" alt=\"L\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Loi-ich-chinh-khi-su-dung-TikTok-Business-Center-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5603\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e3ddfca1-3001-4b08-99f6-03bc4a363ede&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJRKRbgQIcoH498xjgCsl4qmmgkd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JRKRbgQIcoH498xjgCsl4qmmgkd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:356905,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"QnIMdXzVLoggngxQH9wlFDragxe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpBxdONitoOBdQx3tHVlOEoTgUc\">C\u00e1c l\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh khi nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 g\u00ec? Sau \u0111\u00e2y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 tr\u00ean.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-RoEXdRMo5oZAyqx19WPlnjk6gsh\">Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u1eadp trung m\u1ecdi t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ScAIdEqqAoTRobx2sdIlr2uygtd\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a BC l\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 \u1edf c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t n\u01a1i. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng theo d\u00f5i t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, c\u00e1c k\u00eanh TikTok, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c pixel theo d\u00f5i c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp qua l\u1ea1i gi\u1eefa nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KANcdWT1qoPEVIxjodalF2JFgsh\">H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9i nh\u00f3m v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n an to\u00e0n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F4ERdW7yqo7FwTx2YxAl7gzXgwe\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n m\u1eddi c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean trong \u0111\u1ed9i nh\u00f3m ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i v\u00e0o c\u00f9ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd. Quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n chi ti\u1ebft cho t\u1eebng ng\u01b0\u1eddi, v\u00ed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 ch\u1ec9 cho ph\u00e9p m\u1ed9t nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean xem b\u00e1o c\u00e1o nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KubBdZIvSo3DPuxg1efluvhRgfg\">Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vsy8d1ZKZot4GaxSILDl6lYCgwf\">V\u1edbi Business Center, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cho nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00e1c nhau m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch linh ho\u1ea1t. B\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem b\u00e1o c\u00e1o t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn to\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh v\u1ec1 chi ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTuUdF1MBov32fx6vC0liBJqguh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IzqFdRqyOo0DkSxyBkelKwVcgFf\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Business Center<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VPoVdWId1o11ToxMB93l9RL1glc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-TikndkuQ2oK6k3xNm1OlqUhfgrd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1fc4b67c-4dd5-443f-a849-6b5aa1439112&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRXExbAdYuod7NCxStdBl9XX0g3f%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RXExbAdYuod7NCxStdBl9XX0g3f&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:333630,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5604\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5604\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5604\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center.png\" alt=\"H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Business Center\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-thiet-lap-tai-khoan-TikTok-Business-Center-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5604\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Business Center<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WuyPdMs9WoD5jTxEX7PlzjFKgDf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SUcKdPaueoHFj6xC6vylTNMwgbb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Business Center<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LjsaduI9ToO1asxbKwsl1GJigth\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y truy c\u1eadp trang web ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok Business Center t\u1ea1i <strong>business.tiktok.com<\/strong>. Nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1n c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n v\u1ec1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AaugdUq1Ioxiq1xNSkIlJinjg5e\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Th\u00eam t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n (T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, Trang TikTok, Pixel&#8230;)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBCTdFgewoZGG3xNTu1lm6XYg7i\">Sau khi t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n &#8220;y\u00eau c\u1ea7u quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;th\u00eam m\u1edbi&#8221; c\u00e1c t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3, li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi trang TikTok c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p, v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o c\u00e1c pixel theo d\u00f5i m\u1edbi ngay trong giao di\u1ec7n n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QBASdeSbWoumV3xMX6Jl4nOEgMf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: M\u1eddi th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UB4wdHtgJoZLTWxWYV2lMYYigAf\">V\u00e0o m\u1ee5c &#8220;Th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean&#8221; v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n &#8220;M\u1eddi th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean&#8221;, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1eadp email c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn vai tr\u00f2 v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 cho t\u1eebng t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n h\u1ecd truy c\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZ1JdlDqAoUUpDxG27mlArPKgoh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UiuddS9cPot3LGxwGkslsLFBgJb\">Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a TikTok Business Center<\/h2>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vm0pd6AgZoCXMExYNBsl8dB5g8p\">H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi Lemon Digital t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a TikTok Business Center nh\u00e9<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BpFJdc0dHo2wobx07GlloYnyghc\">Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAQodcJrIo0oabx7xO9lTZM0gNf\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n c\u1ed9ng t\u00e1c an to\u00e0n. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00e1c vai tr\u00f2 kh\u00e1c nhau nh\u01b0 &#8220;Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean&#8221; (to\u00e0n quy\u1ec1n) ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch&#8221; (ch\u1ec9 xem b\u00e1o c\u00e1o) cho t\u1eebng th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean tr\u00ean t\u1eebng t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zb2gdbmXDoxvWFxAX2Hl1XQPg7f\">Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y nh\u1eb1m m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 ngh\u0129a v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea1n ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Business Center c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FeoPdz5mvozwHRxZTFsl8oxBghf\">Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n t\u1eadp trung<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRZkdCfpXo1ZpaxHD8rlqgqDgjf\">Business Center cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n xem m\u1ed9t danh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n \u0111ang qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n n\u00e0o b\u1ecb b\u1ecf qu\u00ean ho\u1eb7c truy c\u1eadp tr\u00e1i ph\u00e9p.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YjSgd7YKMoOh2SxQF20le38ngGh\">B\u00e1o c\u00e1o v\u00e0 Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OY0FdZO6EoI1IGxFoG2lr2jtgQb\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c b\u00e1o c\u00e1o t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00e1c nhau. T\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd c\u00f3 c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn to\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i v\u00e0o xem t\u1eebng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ri\u00eang l\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PflOdK79Eo9JVTxwY02lTHllgJu\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FprEdETdcoe3gCxYm1zliO26gzc\">D\u00e0nh cho Agency: Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Business Center<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Emu7dOyVmo0HaUxv0cvlqUj4gEd\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5605\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5605\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5605\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center.png\" alt=\"D\u00e0nh cho Agency: Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Business Center\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Danh-cho-Agency-Quan-ly-nhieu-khach-hang-voi-Business-Center-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5605\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>D\u00e0nh cho Agency: Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Business Center<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqELdp70Fox8bGx1jWmlUvcHgGK\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0S2dHNDRoftIBxQ6QelCiBbg1g\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c Agency qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, Business Center l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu. N\u00f3 cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c ri\u00eang cho t\u1eebng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, gi\u1eef cho t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd (t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, pixel,&#8230;) ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n t\u00e1ch bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng th\u00eam nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 g\u1ee1 b\u1ecf quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp khi d\u1ef1 \u00e1n k\u1ebft th\u00fac m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SoppdXIjvouEhDxCJBplf7Bmg2c\">TikTok Business Center l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trang qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft y\u1ebfu cho b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p n\u00e0o \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nghi\u00eam t\u00fac tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. N\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch khoa h\u1ecdc m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng t\u00ednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 trong h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9i nh\u00f3m. Vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u00f3a c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng marketing c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BBzNdrUyDoFTTnxYOBIlFTCUgrb\">Qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong>Lemon Digital <\/strong>\u0111\u00e3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00eam nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 TikTok Business Center.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OkYhdndSEoVTj1xU8WWliPaFgUO\">B\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c t\u1eadp trung h\u00f3a t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n, ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p b\u00e1o c\u00e1o t\u1ed5ng quan, n\u00f3 mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t, b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n n\u00e0o c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. Vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t n\u1ec1n m\u00f3ng cho s\u1ef1 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hqavd8ENto2AEvx4GN6l4R5DgBf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UAVUdG0rvoZUZdxGARHlnvNVgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Khi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n, vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n, \u0111\u1ed9i nh\u00f3m v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch s\u1ebd tr\u1edf n\u00ean ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. TikTok Business Center ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5721,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5600","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5600","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5600"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5600\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5695,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5600\/revisions\/5695"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5721"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5600"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5600"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5600"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}